{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20026","headline":"上包祭酒 · 孟郊","name":"上包祭酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岳岳冠盖彦，英英文字雄。\n琼音独听时，尘韵固不同。\n春云生纸上，秋涛起胸中。\n时吟五君咏，再举七子风。\n何幸松桂侣，见知勤苦功。\n愿将黄鹤翅，一借飞云空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}